The '''Ubrikkian Trade Tower''' was a high-rise building in the gentrified center of [[Mos Eisley]], [[Tatooine]]. It belonged to the [[starship]] design corporation [[Ubrikkian Industries]]. The tower was located in the largest intersection in town where [[Outer Curved Street]], [[Spacers Row]], and [[Straight Street]] intersected.<ref name="CL 2016" /> It was also the tallest building in the spaceport.<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

